  "description": "For Merton Civic centres approach towards decarbonation the proposal includes provision for a new UKPN substation within part ground floor area of the existing library. This will replace the existing substation. New plants will be provided on the 2nd floor roof and the 15th floor roof. External risers will be provided along the external building façade along London Road to feed into all floors. The proposal will also replace existing redundant plants on the 2nd floor floor and the 15th floor roof.\n",
